flowchart TD
    A[User / Demo Operator] --> B[Dashboard Command Panel]
    B --> C[Command: PING / STATUS / SET_MODE / STOP / RESET]
    C --> D[Web Serial or Bridge Layer]
    D --> E[ESP32 Master]
    E --> F[Command Parser and Router]

    F --> N1[NODE_01_LED_STATE]
    F --> N2[NODE_02_PROXIMITY_SAFETY]
    F --> N3[NODE_03_MAGNETIC_DOCKING]
    F --> N4[NODE_04_MOTION_ACTUATOR]
    F --> N5[NODE_05_TELEMETRY_SENSOR]
    F --> N6[NODE_06_VISION_CAMERA]

    N1 --> R[Node Response]
    N2 --> R
    N3 --> R
    N4 --> R
    N5 --> R
    N6 --> R

    R --> T[Telemetry Packet]
    T --> U[Dashboard Panels / Terminal / Logs]
    U --> V[Simulation State Update]
    V --> W[Demo Output: video, screenshots, GitHub assets]
